<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>All My Friends</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">A Day To Remember</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Big Ole Album Vol. 1</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2wdqcce0DKklq4aSD8zADU</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.141" end="00:02.811">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.811" end="00:05.588">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.588" end="00:08.292">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.292" end="00:11.310">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.310" end="00:12.810" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.811" end="00:15.567">I got a text from the crew in my hometown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.567" end="00:17.556">It said be ready to roll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.556" end="00:21.055">I'm ride or die so they know not to ask me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.055" end="00:23.175">Ya, cause they already know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.175" end="00:24.675">I turned on the radio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.585" end="00:26.560">They're playin' The Boys Are Back in Town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.560" end="00:28.857">The boys are back in town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.857" end="00:30.357">Hype me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.896" end="00:31.840">There's no way I'm a come down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.840" end="00:33.381" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.381" end="00:34.881">It's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.989" end="00:36.566">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.566" end="00:39.517">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.517" end="00:42.133">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.133" end="00:45.230">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.230" end="00:46.730" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.630" end="00:48.037">When we walk in the door everybody's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.037" end="00:50.126">Man I ain't lookin' for trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.126" end="00:53.430">It's like ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.430" end="00:56.645">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.645" end="00:58.145" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.070" end="01:00.584">The bartender asked do you wanna make that a double</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.584" end="01:02.664">Ya, 42 or Patron (uh 42)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.664" end="01:06.217">It burned on the way down but after a couple</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.217" end="01:08.336">I threw 'em back like a pro</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.336" end="01:10.303">Now Cody's behind me, he's screamin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.303" end="01:13.692">Tonight is for the boys (tonight is for the boys)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.692" end="01:15.192">We're gonna hurt in the mornin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.101" end="01:17.212">But there's no turnin' back now (back now)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.212" end="01:18.712" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.404" end="01:19.904">It's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.109" end="01:21.715">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.715" end="01:24.685">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.685" end="01:27.332">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.332" end="01:30.398">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.398" end="01:31.898" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.716" end="01:33.187">When we walk in the door everybody's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.187" end="01:35.300">Man I ain't lookin' for trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.300" end="01:38.676">It's like ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.676" end="01:41.798">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.798" end="01:49.798" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.452" end="01:54.952">Put your drink in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.628" end="01:57.131">And toast to the right here and right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.131" end="01:58.644">Paint this town tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.644" end="02:00.144" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.020" end="02:00.520">Put your drink in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.252" end="02:02.740">And toast to the right here and right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.740" end="02:04.293">Burn it down tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.293" end="02:05.793" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.683" end="02:06.183">Put your drink in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.916" end="02:08.413">And toast to the right here and right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.413" end="02:09.913">Paint this town tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.892" end="02:11.392" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.307" end="02:11.807">Put your drink in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.555" end="02:14.116">And toast to the right here and right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.116" end="02:16.370">Burn it down tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.370" end="02:24.370" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.790" end="02:27.290">Everybody sing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.564" end="02:28.064" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.829" end="02:29.479">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.479" end="02:32.470">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.470" end="02:35.141">Ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.141" end="02:38.157">Another night out here with all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.157" end="02:39.657" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.518" end="02:40.886">When we walk in the door everybody's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.886" end="02:43.101">Man I ain't lookin' for trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.101" end="02:46.454">It's like ah shit here we go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.454" end="02:50.454">Another night out here with all my friends</p></div></body></tt>